+    /// Install this window's native text-edit admission callback.
+    ///
+    /// A refused request performs no native text, cursor, composition or history
+    /// mutation. The callback must inspect the borrowed request without
+    /// changing native input state or reading the clipboard again. Capture weak
+    /// application/window handles to avoid an ownership cycle. Reentrant native
+    /// edits are refused until the admitted operation has completed.
+    /// Register after associating the window's root component. Replacing that
